### ==========================================
### ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES (CHANGE YOUR IP HERE)
### ==========================================
@host = http://localhost:8080
# Paste tokens from the login responses below
@dispatcherToken = paste-dispatcher-token
@paramedicToken = paste-paramedic-token
@adminToken = paste-admin-token
@samplePassword = change-me-sample
@adminEmail = admin@mediflow.local
@adminPassword = change-me-admin
### ==========================================
### 0. SETUP: CREATE OUR USERS
### Registration is admin-only. Log in as the bootstrap admin
### (BOOTSTRAP_ADMIN_EMAIL / BOOTSTRAP_ADMIN_PASSWORD) and paste the token into @adminToken.
### ==========================================

### Login as Bootstrap Admin
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{adminEmail}}",
  "password": "{{adminPassword}}"
}

### Create Dispatcher
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "name": "Dave Dispatcher",
  "email": "dispatcher@mediflow.com",
  "password": "{{samplePassword}}",
  "role": "DISPATCHER"
}

### Create Paramedic
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "name": "Pam Paramedic",
  "email": "paramedic@mediflow.com",
  "password": "{{samplePassword}}",
  "role": "PARAMEDIC"
}


### ==========================================
### SCENARIO 1: Valid Dispatcher Creates Emergency
### ==========================================

### 1A. Login as Dispatcher (Copy the token from the response!)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "dispatcher@mediflow.com",
  "password": "{{samplePassword}}"
}

### 1B. Create Emergency (Paste token below)
POST {{host}}/api/emergency
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$uuid}}
Authorization: Bearer {{dispatcherToken}}

{
  "patientId": "PAT-98775",
  "severity": "CRITICAL",
  "latitude": 28.6139,
  "longitude": 77.2090
}


### ==========================================
### SCENARIO 2: Invalid JWT is Rejected
### ==========================================

### 2A. Attempt request with fake token
POST {{host}}/api/emergency
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: 123765
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.fake.token

### EXPECTED: 401 Unauthorized


### ==========================================
### SCENARIO 3: Paramedic Cannot Create Hospital
### ==========================================

### 3A. Login as Paramedic (Copy the token!)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "paramedic@mediflow.com",
  "password": "{{samplePassword}}"
}

### 3B. Attempt to access a restricted Admin endpoint
POST {{host}}/api/hospitals
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: 2398736
Authorization: Bearer {{paramedicToken}}

{
  "name": "City General",
  "totalBeds": 150,
  "latitude": 28.6139,
  "longitude": 77.2090
}

### EXPECTED: 403 Forbidden


### ==========================================
### SCENARIO 4: Admin Creates Hospital
### ==========================================

### 4A. Login as Admin (Copy the token!)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{adminEmail}}",
  "password": "{{adminPassword}}"
}

### 4B. Admin accesses restricted endpoint
POST {{host}}/api/hospitals
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: 234546
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "name": "City General",
  "totalBeds": 150,
  "latitude": 28.6139,
  "longitude": 77.2090
}

### EXPECTED: 201 Created


### ==========================================
### ADD A NEW AMBULANCE
### ==========================================

### Add Advanced Life Support Ambulance
POST {{host}}/api/ambulances
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$uuid}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "registrationNumber": "DL-1D-AA-1123",
  "capabilities": "ALS, Ventilator, Defibrillator",
  "crewInfo": "2 Paramedics, 1 Driver"
}


### ==========================================
### ADD A NEW HOSPITAL
### ==========================================

### Admin accesses restricted endpoint using proper DTO payload
POST {{host}}/api/hospitals
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$uuid}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "hospitalName": "Apollo Downtown 7",
  "availableBeds": 250,
  "latitude": 28.6150,
  "longitude": 77.2100
}

### ==========================================
### ASSIGN THE PARAMEDIC TO AN AMBULANCE
### Paramedics may only record pickups/deliveries for their assigned ambulance.
### Find the user id with GET /api/auth/users, then log in again to get a token carrying the assignment.
### ==========================================

### List users
GET {{host}}/api/auth/users
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Assign
PUT {{host}}/api/auth/users/2/ambulance
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "ambulanceId": "paste-ambulance-id"
}
